the platform can add
open source that

00:38:15.841 --> 00:38:19.050
the platform can help to

00:38:19.051 --> 00:38:21.535
encourage the results sharing

00:38:21.536 --> 00:38:25.730
and for collaborative innovation.

00:38:25.731 --> 00:38:27.720
So here is the overview of

00:38:27.721 --> 00:38:31.575
the AI platform that in my mind.

00:38:31.576 --> 00:38:35.780
The underlying infrastructure
layer including hardware

00:38:35.781 --> 00:38:37.455
and the various of

00:38:37.456 --> 00:38:41.440
