00:52:32.751 --> 00:52:35.175
Before the big data area,

00:52:35.176 --> 00:52:41.220
if you look at
the distributed process,

00:52:41.221 --> 00:52:45.645
they usually,
the scheduling primitives,

00:52:45.646 --> 00:52:49.450
usually timesharing
migration, et cetera.

00:52:49.451 --> 00:52:52.240
So, what is the right
primitive before

00:52:52.241 --> 00:52:57.420
deep learning's workload is
