00:53:27.271 --> 00:53:31.365
like virtual memory and
some of the technology like

00:53:31.366 --> 00:53:34.970
memory compression
essentially to optimize

00:53:34.971 --> 00:53:43.300
the GPU management during
deep learning model chaining.

00:53:45.640 --> 00:53:50.695
We have identified
several case where

00:53:50.696 --> 00:53:56.890
certain deep learning
technology like the Auto ML,

00:53:56.891 --> 00:53:59.080
have reasons may have

